    {
      "text": "When ~20 minutes is left on the Instant Pot, pre-heat oven to 400F. Place broccoli florets into a baking dish/tray and toss in oil, Italian seasoning, and salt and pepper to taste. Bake for 20-25 minutes or until edges are browned.",
